      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TENNESSEE KADE (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at The Gardens over 515m (29.73). Form here at the trip excellent including three wins. The form from her last run stacks up well. Has winning claims on her best figures. NOT AGAIN (2) has missed the frame the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner three back (22.02) at Gosford over 388m. Well placed here and can atone this time. WINSOME STORM (3) dropped out early but hit the line hard, charging into third and beaten 7 lengths win (29.95) at this track in NG. Expected to be in this for a long way. MEPUNGA WHISKEY (7) is in the mix after placing in good time last start.",
